#. spellRulings.public-demo
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:23
msgctxt "text:spellRulings.public-demo"
msgid "Approved for public demonstration"
msgstr "公開試演可"

#. spellRulings.conditional
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:24
msgctxt "text:spellRulings.conditional"
msgid "Approved with red-cord conditions"
msgstr "赤紐条件付可"

#. spellRulings.research-only
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:25
msgctxt "text:spellRulings.research-only"
msgid "Closed research simulation only"
msgstr "閉鎖研究模擬のみ"

#. spellRulings.revise
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:26
msgctxt "text:spellRulings.revise"
msgid "Design retained; revise and defend again"
msgstr "設計保存・再答弁"

#. spellConditions.corridor
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:30
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.corridor"
msgid "Fix the minimum safe corridor and cue in the performance version."
msgstr "最低安全回廊と予告を正式実演版へ固定すること。"

#. spellConditions.version
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:31
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.version"
msgid "Publish seed, parameters, collision version, venue conditions, and failed runs."
msgstr "種・パラメータ・当たり版・会場条件・失敗回を公開すること。"

#. spellConditions.audience
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:32
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.audience"
msgid "Verify audience readability with independent observation or a pre-performance cue."
msgstr "独立観察または実演前予告で観客の可読性を検証すること。"

#. spellConditions.performance
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:33
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.performance"
msgid "Lock projectile budget and collision core; performance loss may not change the rule."
msgstr "同時弾数と当たり核を固定し、性能低下で規則を変えないこと。"

#. spellConditions.care
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:34
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.care"
msgid "Shorten sessions, retain a stop signal and exit/rest, then measure again."
msgstr "時間短縮・停止合図・途中離脱休憩を設け、修正後再測定すること。"

#. spellConditions.simulation
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:35
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.simulation"
msgid "No public flight; parameters, simulation, and research question may be retained."
msgstr "公開試飛禁止。パラメータ・模擬・研究課題は保存可。"

#. spellConditions.sharedSpace
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:36
msgctxt "text:spellConditions.sharedSpace"
msgid "Put shared-space rehearsal, sound pressure, and breaks on the same timeline."
msgstr "共用会場の稽古・音圧・休止を同じ時系列表へ記載すること。"

#. notice
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:159
msgctxt "text:notice"
msgid "Today's court has only ordinary wind, meaning nobody admits to changing it."
msgstr "本日の試演場は通常風向のみ。通常とは、誰も風向変更を認めていない状態を指す。"

#. workshopConditions
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:162
msgctxt "text:workshopConditions"
msgid ""
"Moonlit afterimages linger half a beat longer; fatigue does not become half "
"a beat shorter."
msgstr "月光残像が延長。同じ予告は半拍長く残るが、疲労は半拍減らない。"

#. workshopConditions
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:166
msgctxt "text:workshopConditions.2"
msgid ""
"Nitori replaced the collision logger; the tape on the old box remains listed "
"as a fallback version."
msgstr "にとりが当たり記録箱を交換。旧箱のテープは予備版として残る。"

#. workshopConditions
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:169
msgctxt "text:workshopConditions.3"
msgid ""
"Bamboo mist has borrowed the court edge. Subtract three feet from every "
"corridor unless you can show where the mist stands."
msgstr "竹霧が試演場の縁を借用。霧の立ち位置を示せない限り、安全回廊から三尺差し引く。"

#. workshopConditions
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:172
msgctxt "text:workshopConditions.4"
msgid ""
"Two returning holdings circle above the audience. The library insists this "
"is not a second danmaku layer."
msgstr "帰航資料二冊が観客席上空を旋回中。図書館は第二弾幕ではないと主張。"

#. communityCopy/aya
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/aya"
msgid "Bunbunmaru Public-Demo Wire"
msgstr "文々。公開試演速報"

#. communityCopy/panel
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/panel"
msgid "Spell-Card Ethics Defence Record"
msgstr "スペルカード倫理答弁記録席"

#. communityCopy/chorus
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/chorus"
msgid "Misty Lake Fairy Chorus"
msgstr "霧の湖妖精合唱団"

#. communityCopy/headline
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/headline"
msgid "Public defence receives a ruling"
msgstr "公開答弁に裁定"

#. communityCopy/correction
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/correction"
msgid ""
"Correction: approval does not erase conditions, and the red cord is not "
"stage decoration."
msgstr "訂正：可決は条件消滅を意味せず、赤紐も舞台装飾ではない。"

#. communityCopy/panelBody
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/panelBody"
msgid ""
"Three examiners preserve separate views on rules, reproducibility, and "
"external risk; minority opinion was not folded into the majority."
msgstr "三名は規則・再現・外部リスクの意見を別々に保存。少数意見は多数結論へ折り畳まれていない。"

#. communityCopy/chorusBody
#: src/js/spellcard-workshop-model.js:512
msgctxt "tree:communityCopy#/chorusBody"
msgid ""
"The chorus reviewed the timeline and drew a rest larger than the "
"university's wherever the design forgot to breathe."
msgstr "合唱団は時系列表を確認し、息継ぎのない箇所すべてへ大学より大きな休止符を描いた。"
